\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  God shall carefully control me,
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0 So that all goes well with me
\par Therefore let the billows roll on;
\par See, your Saviour fallows close.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Why are you disturbed inwardly?
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0 Is your master fast asleep?
\par See, your misery is boneless,
\par Your doubt calls for just reproach.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Doubtful fellow, know your master
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0 He does not slumber nor sleep.
\par You must only gather faith and
\par Draw to Him for salvation.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Whether He delays salvation;
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0 Whether it is immediate,
\par The father's love never changes,
\par Your pains are His own pains too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  Strongly believe that the Lord God
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0 Only wishes you success.
\par If only you will be patient,
\par Your worries will  have an end.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  If you ever should be confused,
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0 Place your hopes on Him always.
\par He controls our woes for the day,
\par  And for the next day as well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   7.  The Lord still extends His calling;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj And His power is unfathomed.
\par Fear  not  e'en  if  you are burdened;
\par For the 'Mighty will take care.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  8.   By His numerous acts of mystery,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 He lights your candle of faith.
\par And in all His numerous acts,
\par Fault can never be perceived.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   9.  When His hour of salvation comes;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 His redemption shall appear.
\par It shall come with all suddenness,
\par And you will be confounded.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 10. Therefore bear each one his own cross,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 In humility, patience.
\par  They that avert sufferings here.
\par  Flee and to get entangled.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 11\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  11.  Those that did embrace the Lord's cross
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  By virtue of holy tears
\par  Shall receive the coveted crown
\par  After their struggle and pain.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 12\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 12.  Amen, Amen, in Jesus' name,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0    I maintain silence and calm.
\par   May it be to me as He wants,
\par \pard       Today and eternally!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

